nity Central European University aims to secure a stimulating and supportive working, teaching, learning, and social environment which promotes equality and equity, and respects the rights and dignity of all academic and administrative staff, prospective, current and former students, associate members, bidders, contracting parties, and visitors to the University. Learn More Family - Friendly University In 2023, CEU has been awarded the basic certificate university and family by the Austrian Federal Ministry of Women, Family, Integration and Media. This award demonstrates our commitment to family-friendly measures and offerings within the framework of family-conscious employment and study policies. Family - Friendly University Meet Our Faculty CEU is a university shaped by the ideas, expertise, and dedication of its faculty. Through their teaching, research, and engagement, our faculty foster an environment where critical thinking and academic excellence thrive. This series offers a closer look at the people behind the classrooms, sharing their perspectives, passions, and the journeys that brought them to CEU. Meet our Faculty - YouTube Playlist Join Our CEU Talent Pool Want to stay connected with Central European University? Join our Talent Pool to hear about upcoming opportunities, events, and what makes CEU a unique international community in the heart of Vienna. Click here to stay connected! Our Awards Careers Home CEU Home Data Privacy Contact Us Cookie Statement Accessibility Imprint/Impressum Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Copyright © Central European University Postal Address Austria: Central European University Private University | Quellenstraße 51 | A-1100 Wien, Austria | Vienna Commercial Court | FN 502313 x Postal Address Hungary: Közép-európai Egyetem | Nádor u. 9. | 1051 Budapest, Hungary"
