    "https://www.ceu.edu/open-positions": {
      "title": "Open Positions",
      "description": "Open Positions Skip to main content About CEU is known for excellence in teaching and research—with purpose. About CEU Leadership at CEU Campus Accreditation Facts and Figures Sustainability Academics CEU delivers a wide range of degree programs at the bachelor's, master's and doctoral levels. Study at CEU Degree Programs Advanced Certificates Schools and Departments Non-Degree Programs Academic Partnerships CEU Science for Society Hub Admissions and Aid Over 50 degree programs available to explore, from network sciences to economics, to environmental sciences and more. Admissions and Aid Tuition and Other Fees Funding Your Studies Research Funds for Enrolled Students Connect and Learn More Research CEU promotes interdisciplinary research on 21st-century issues, incorporating Central European and American traditions. Research Research Centers Research Groups Research Projects Research and Teaching Opportunities Student Life CEU is a vibrant community of students, faculty, staff and alumni from over 100 countries. Student Life at CEU Student Center Student Engagement Office Student Records Office Career Office Psychological Counseling Search 35 Years News Events Alumni Intranet Give Shop Search Type Academic Department (16) Academic Program (59) Article (2077) Page (278) Unit Department of Historical Studies (100) Doctoral School of Political Science, Public Policy, and International Relations (85) Department of Political Science (83) Department of Environmental Sciences and Policy (83) Department of Network and Data Science (79) Department of Economics (68) Department of Legal Studies (62) Department of Gender Studies (60) Department of Philosophy (57) Department of International Relations (55) Department of Cognitive Science (51) School of Undergraduate Studies (46) Romani Studies Program (17) Summer University (8) 51 (1) Show more Categories News (870) Research News (217) Press Releases (139) CIVICA: The European University of Social Sciences (114) Podcast (79) President and Rector (77) Pressemeldungen (76) Redefining the Rules (68) Giving (54) Transforming Knowledge into Action (43) Uniting a Global Community (38) Alumni Stories (25) Invisible University for Ukraine (22) Sustainability (19) 35 Years News (11) Research Excellence Award (8) Teaching Excellence Award (7) CEU Science for Society Hub (7) International Relations Blog Posts (7) Awards and Distinctions (4) Student Stories (4) Open Society Prize (4) Board of Trustees (4) Admissions (3) Visual Studies Platform (1) Educational Outreach Office (1) Open Positions (1) Show more Date 2026 (203) 2025 (392) 2024 (302) 2023 (289) 2022 (431) 2021 (478) 2020 (319) Show more Sort Relevant first Newest first Oldest first Home Open Positions For freelance visiting faculty opportunities at Central European University, please see the individual posts from different academic departments below. If you are interested in employment opportunities, please refer to our careers homepage . Job Announcement at CEU, Department of Economics: Data Analytics for Economists - Part-time Visiting Lecturer The Department of Economics at Central European University (CEU) invites applications for a Visiting Lecturer position in Data Analytics for Economists . This is a part-time teaching-focused position with a moderate service component. Read more about Job Announcement at CEU, Department of Economics: Data Analytics for Economists - Part-time Visiting Lecturer Directories & Media Inquiries People Directory CEU Media Relations Careers at CEU Contact Academic Resources CEU Library Course Catalog Blinken OSA Archivum Podcast Library Research Portal Quick Links Moodle/E-Learning IT Services Institutional Catalog CEU Policies Academic Calendar Legal & Compliance Accessibility and Disability Inclusion Cookie Statement Data Privacy Notice Equal Opportunity Whistleblowing Platform Imprint/Impressum © Central European University The Central European University website uses cookies to ensure the basic functionality of the site and for statistical and optimization purposes. It also uses cookies to display content such as YouTube videos and for marketing purposes. You may either accept or reject usage of cookies via the following buttons. Learn more: CEU Cookie Statement Cookies Settings Only essential cookies Accept all cookies Privacy Preference Center When you visit any website, it may store or retrieve information on your browser, mostly in the form of cookies. This information might be about you, your preferences, or your device, and is mostly used to make the site work as you expect. The information does not usually identify you directly, but it can give you a more personalized web experience. Because we respect your right to privacy, you can choose not to allow some types of cookies. Click on the different category headings to learn more and change our default settings. Blocking some types of cookies may impact your experience of the site and the services we are able to offer. CEU Cookie Statement Allow All Manage Consent Preferences Essential Cookies Always Active These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be switched off in our systems. They are usually only set in response to actions made by you which amount to a request for services, such as setting your privacy preferences, logging in or filling in forms. You can set your browser to block or alert you about these cookies, but some parts of the site will not then work. These cookies do not store any personally identifiable information. Functional Cookies Functional Cookies These cookies enable the website to provide enhanced functionality and personalisation. They may be set by us or by third party providers whose services we have added to our pages. If you do not allow these cookies then some or all of these services may not function properly. Performance Cookies Performance Cookies These cookies allow us to count visits and traffic sources so we can measure and improve the performance of our site. They help us to know which pages are the most and least popular and see how visitors move around the site. All information these cookies collect is aggregated and therefore anonymous. If you do not allow these cookies we will not know when you have visited our site, and will not be able to monitor its performance. Targeting Cookies Targeting Cookies These cookies may be set through our site by our advertising partners. They may be used by those companies to build a profile of your interests and show you relevant adverts on other sites. They do not store directly personal information, but are based on uniquely identifying your browser and internet device. If you do not allow these cookies, you will experience less targeted advertising. Back Button Cookie List Search Icon Filter Icon Clear checkbox label label Apply Cancel Consent Leg.Interest checkbox label label checkbox label label checkbox label label Reject All Confirm My Choices"
    },
